{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://hk.on.cc/hk/bkn/cnt/news/20261023/photo/bkn-20261023093959336-1023_00822_001_01p.jpg?20261023134839\"/><p>巴士險闖輕鐵路軌。</p><p>屯門發生交通意外。今晨(23日)9時25分，一輛路線為258D的雙層九巴，沿田景路往寶田邨方向行駛，至近田景輕鐵站對開時，突然失控撞向路中鐵欄，險衝進輕鐵路軌，幸無撞及列車，事件中無人受傷。九巴就事件回覆指，已即時暫停涉事車長的駕駛職務，並正調查事件。</p><p>on.cc東網</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-23T05:55:04.492591+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":144,"images":1,"source":"東網 本地","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-23T01:39:59+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-23T13:38:15.511014+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-23T05:49:40.670390+00:00","content_hash":"984873ff375c546a935033a9d34b28623819bd95b605d01e58a745d98988bc15","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-10-23T05:55:04.492591+00:00","latest_fallback":"minimal","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}